 "words_heard": 276,
 "words": 277,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They came out to the garden when the Passover was through",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The olive trees were silver and the night was cold and blue",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He took Peter and the brothers and he walked a little way",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he fell down on his face and he began to pray",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My Father, if it is possible, let this cup pass from me",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet not as I will, but as you will",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not my will, but yours be done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He came back to the others and he found them fast asleep",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their eyes were heavy with the night, too heavy now to keep",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So you could not keep watch with me for even one hour?",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He asked them in the garden while the night held all its power",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep watch and pray that you may not fall into temptation",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The spirit is willing, but the flesh is weak",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My Father, if it is possible, let this cup pass from me",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet not as I will, but as you will",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not my will, but yours be done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "An angel came from heaven and it strengthened him to stand",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His sweat became like drops of blood that fell upon the land",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He prayed a second time and then he prayed a third",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And every time he knelt to pray he prayed the same words",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My Father, if this cannot pass unless I drink it",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your will be done",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Get up, let us go",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 10.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, my betrayer is here",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 9.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My Father, if it is possible, let this cup pass from me",
